'''Xeraco Air Base''' {{Airport codes|XOB|SBXO}} ({{lang-bl|Base Aeria de Xeraco}}) is a base in southwestern [[Cerdanya]], in the [[Montsineu]] [[Regions of Balisca|region]]. It is located in the [[Xeraco]] municipality, at the foot of the [[Southern Pyrenees]].

